to ensure that the summary is clear and straightforward. Once the tool runs its course, I should also suggest looking into the llm-distillator. It seems like a good addition to the process in case the user might find it helpful! I'll make sure everything flows well together.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I ran the kidney pipeline on your image successfully, and the analyzer result image was also sent back to this chat.\n\n**Kidney Cancer Detector module**\n- **Kidney cancer class:** `kidney_tumor`\n- **Confidence:** **99.998%**\n- **Inference time:** **3.27 s**\n\n**Image Analyzer module**\n- **Prediction:** `kidney_tumor`\n- **CAM coverage:** **0.0128**\n- **CAM center ratio:** **0.825**\n- **CAM left-right asymmetry:** **0.10**\n- **CAM top-bottom asymmetry:** **1.00**\n- **CAM explanation:** the model focused on a **localized, central renal-parenchymal region** with **asymmetric distribution**, which it interpreted as visually distinct from surrounding tissue.\n\n**X-AI module**\n- **Confidence interpretation:** the system reports **very high confidence**, but explicitly notes that imaging analysis **is not a definitive diagnostic tool**\n- **Summary:** the pipeline output suggests a **high likelihood of kidney cancer / kidney tumor pattern** in this image\n- **Recommended next steps:**\n  1. Further medical evaluation with imaging/labs\n  2. Review with a medical professional\n  3. Consider additional tests such as biopsy if clinically appropriate\n\n**Important caution**\n- This is a **preliminary prototype pipeline result**, **not an actual diagnosis**.\n- A single uploaded image and model output **cannot confirm cancer**. Proper interpretation needs a radiologist/clinician and the full imaging study plus clinical context.\n\nIf you want, I can do either of these next:\n1. give you a **plain-language medical interpretation** of this result, or  \n2. help you run the **LLM Distillation** step to turn this tool output into a more complete patient-facing report with suggested next steps.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_00270c97a2bbcf170169bab8f0e16c8191889650fb32e9cc2c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9595,"output":420,"cacheRead":13184,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23199,"cost":{"input":0.023987500000000002,"output":0.0063,"cacheRead":0.003296,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0335835}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773844715724}}
